abstract: >-
  Open-source layer that lets any user-side AI agent (Claude Code, Codex CLI)
  autonomously find, order and pay for goods on real e-commerce sites under a
  pre-signed purchase mandate, with site-skills shared through a community
  registry. MVP market: Poland (Allegro.pl, OLX.pl).
